title: 'Decided: the root''s author throughout, even beneath a third author''s notes.'
pid: ff5001fe-8347-44a8-a6c1-e71c06acd044
body: |2-
  Jeff's words are "as if the viewer were that foreign author", and
  that author, viewing, follows only their own overrides everywhere.
  The other reading, each parent's author, would make one view follow
  several people at once, and no one would ever see it. One owner per
  tree is also the simplest rule: decided once, at the root.
